          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"product-review-sentiment-classifier\">Product review sentiment classifier</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Classify the same twelve product reviews with two local models and compare their results.</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='Hbol-0' random-id='2ff394e1-e1e8-7e06-6b22-4db4c050f681'><marimo-text data-initial-value='&quot;gemma3:1b&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eModel A&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;text&quot;' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true'></marimo-text></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='Hbol-1' random-id='e996902f-cdc6-c2e2-10cb-0888dd51e779'><marimo-text data-initial-value='&quot;qwen3:1.7b&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eModel B&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;text&quot;' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true'></marimo-text></marimo-ui-element></div><marimo-ui-element object-id='Hbol-2' random-id='c056955c-738b-15b2-0266-ef860443ed83'><marimo-text-area data-initial-value='&quot;Oh wonderful, another charger that lasts a whole three weeks. Just what I needed.&#92;nThe product itself is fantastic, but the courier left it in the rain.&#92;nNot bad. Not great. I keep using it, which probably says something.&#92;nI wanted to hate this but I can&#x27;t. Annoyingly good.&#92;nFive stars for the packaging. The thing inside? Different story.&#92;nDoes exactly what the listing says. That is neither a compliment nor a complaint.&#92;nReturned it. Then bought it again. Make of that what you will.&#92;nIf you enjoy reading 40-page manuals to brew coffee, this is the product for you.&#92;nCustomer service was great. Shame I had to call them four times.&#92;nHonestly underwhelming for the price, but I can see why some people love it.&#92;nBuild quality is solid, instructions are terrible.&#92;nIt works. My cat is unimpressed. I am cautiously optimistic.&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eReviews, one per line&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true' data-full-width='true' data-rows='10'></marimo-text-area></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='Hbol-3' random-id='3057f273-8048-0cdd-9e41-a05fe2b0095a'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eClassify with both models&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element></div>"
